units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
timestep 0.001
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 10 10 10

pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * /scratch/gilbreth/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt2.potential
mass 1 58.6934

velocity all create 600.0 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol

fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 2500.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
reset_timestep 0
run 10
